obj_id: agentGenerated_RegionalSalesProfitabilityRiskAnalysis-440f44f7
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Regional Sales Profitability Risk Analysis
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: de9829d4-7c12-4cd6-a287-d596bdab9fb4
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Central region showing critical 7.92% profit margin vs 14.94% in West region
        • Excessive discounting in Central region at 24% vs 10.9% in West
        • Tables and Furniture categories generating significant losses across regions
        • Clear inverse correlation between discount rates and profitability

        Recommendations:
        • Implement immediate discount controls in Central region, targeting 15% maximum
        • Review pricing strategy for Tables and Furniture categories or consider discontinuation
        • Focus sales efforts on West region model replication in underperforming areas
